    "material_gap_rationale": "A steady-state gap of a quarter of a receiver's decode throughput at matched settings outweighs the integration and maintenance cost of a second decoder dependency, so it changes which decoder a receiver deploys and needs attribution; it lies outside the equivalence margin."
